  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "有鳥黃足，歸呼季玉。從我睢陽，可避刀兵。與福俱行，有命久長。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:146f4480d2bd588157d978f39761c5e519a896e52be6271424a1ac95d3dd0f75",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7ea16736113bffc5f101b34babfe807a73c937141813b8afdfa70db8d92fe3db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "太王為父，季歷孝友。文武聖明，仁德興起。孔張四國，載福綏厚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de7e31d834c2b0ffe8f6c992593333b018f9cfb58133bb2b730f3bf5f952824b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c04f24bad853b9f987f4f87447d84e3ad905bcd17d00e60c4424dbd6ea4c942c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "猿墮高木，不踒手足。保我全生，還歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cbd42a594e191eb7724f9529b042a5ef355b17b12c856108f686d7713aa42b5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:49bc876bfd854952ea8e0f8991f2cae5a05520bed48c589a3814bcf8ac1a0b7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "重耳恭敏，遇讒出處。北奔戎狄，經涉齊楚。以秦代懷，誅殺子圉，身為伯主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0793155d9e478b2ba541aed770b4c9e409fa11847b098412abfddb6720ccf048",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8adb5ef9be7766d5d8a96b734c8df76673b8d58f01bc0e650786916ea4711292"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "倚鋒據戟，傷我胸臆，耗折不息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da2a9686611b351a69e7d97ba66c93baef2a210fa49b0dcc84d0802da4acf3af",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2f7524f58f19d64b24e3fad24343286b87979f381a4af7c07358c795a52586a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "狗冠雞步，君失其所。出門抵山，行者憂難。水灌我園，高陸為泉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7addd650c44528f34352f7e649505dc9b3ff095adfe59c3b0eaa1e9e0bb9f60c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d678bbf70bb80430e98b7753604bd8747ca17286ed1830b684348623322830d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "眾鳥所翔，中有大怪。丈身長頸，為我驚憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f057022dcb016accde87ece8051f1116e63cf19ff11b982693f3b261ed065202",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:918d6a623f384c426f17cb0ba297c4685660adb55f8045a7cf71e228a91d4c62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "虎行相逐，未有休息。戰於平陸，為夷所覆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e0555c9497c717847aa8c385fb60f3999e0899c180561a104d09dfb901f4dee8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8341c39be572ec72b653e24670ce05a060d2ea01fb263b0bae088e0df37b5bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "禹鑿龍門，通利水泉。同注滄海，民得安然。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1374246ee9b9e22a7ce261f85f57bbdf0acf3cc2a77ebb913ee05f430362900b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2960cb57a89519623b6a3d77daee6a2e92eb435212060cbac8fce552558e72a3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "堯舜仁德，養賢致福。眾英積聚，國無寇賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2c7042dd723b6954065e7b9e451b076f2c0227ad33273f3060997f779f01d1f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d42beeac1926e9a22de570aa047575c6329b04c59a1780be3fad6de66f0af617"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "陸居少泉，山高無雲。車行千里，塗不污輪。渴我為怨。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f37105601375dbe5311a520032567a238662bce1b0c738a0f5c7b46a380c245b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0e1014aae09f5624f4d96204ff21fdfaf9e0213db9f8af59e00c1ad40dae86bd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "朝不見光，夜不見明。暝抵空床，季女奔亡。愴然心傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b9b76931984def02f837f491d02c9c7e291329638d542f942c8c5ed2d18876a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:21b302809bc8df19efed05dca9ee774b229bbb0a5f6f4cc6587e2944ef83f3f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "齊魯永國，仁聖輔德。造禮雅言，定公以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bca17dd242fe5ca5867c695ea53bad2351e6b8cd02aa47aa67d4631027d764d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9ef9e71920241ad6845d59a4e742b3f5753a74868f8f06f0abc0823fc9340661"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "束帛元圭，君以布德。伊呂百里，應聘輔國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bdfc7ec771f6d1418b339ad84867fffa3cc1c1ac116659d062b5bb01183697f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa2dda5f2c84a2d06312b21ef1bf7cca0dbfff311e7ec6637a911e822933fb62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "棘鉤我襦，為絆所拘。靈巫拜祝，禍不成災。東山之邑，中有肥土，可以饒飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:80cead66d6b6bde42932124ac26d08c1eaf1f609ad7a6a347e743e3add02a8e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:229247518f9f972c0fc6cbc524149e332b00b22465ae49bebecc2807c737fba5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "門燒屋燔，為下所殘。西行出戶，順其道理。虎臥不起，牛羊歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d1b4d8384440e1622c979b2c12f693c04f47db39e963f77d775399c2a6fffe4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b9e82ca759e38fe10e0581b7e3f2a92cd5c38163d71e3b60565b3a9e36e75cbc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "牆高蔽目，崑崙翳日。遠行無明，不見懽叔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:029cd5437e366c23a2d8cb16a36f85a3b2d678a49afd112e82a2dfab975b8699",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:547a4c4fe8dff5ee702312c16600b075defe6237779844cc9b5ff78873fefeab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "天地際會，不見內外。祖辭遣送，與世長訣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2552a6d21a8a10109c5ce0eb2642ea01646a813633a733c41750bb788a824c15",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd0e52868603893f32af05ec4fcd54642f1ab03d0f6ab0247cbf18cf1ecb9652"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "深水難涉，泥塗至轂。牛罷不進，浮陷為疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e3b6f387721b069ca87a86218c6f4caf4742f39748691a5e28b77c421ebb5368",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:504d44fba65eb2ae95a71de648ee0f50019ff0a02289d88e3b96b5f8d727f2db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "羊驚虎狼，獼猴群走。無益於僵，為齒所傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7fa2f574fc1bafec2e267883ed8ebd6a139240b1c9dd68ad8f98982d7cce91c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e6e29a7c8025ec17c2cb68b50ead898882769a52f4f3fa0176d58265e0cf7af"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "履蛇躡虺，與鬼相視。驚恐失氣，如騎虎尾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6661507b717eac132ba27f838e8e4de535e9df0f2c33dcdb094426fc919160ef",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:846aa34f15f144991825a9cedf5ab38e5f8fbe40b403732a4baa4d7639fd195b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "車驚人傾，兩輪脫去。行者不止，人生憂懼。結締復解，夜明為喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fccc0f62efd71115a8903348ee375dac5f60c20c66ad05674d49a48c4af84047",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fb8d05eecfa69808dce4eb86ee7f729c47c5790bac3d67ef383226609c848ca2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "南販北賈，與喜為市，利得百倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ecb098c1f3065502e7ba085c562212feb7883d86159100f0066fc6a78a8a1a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5ba15a5cd58b80ed02cdfa8cb1c06e94d8f4279ba5419486faf52e3b0e15b3e1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "延陵適魯，觀樂太史。車鄰白顛，知秦興起。卒兼其國，一統為主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:777924b5742c1ce4b39b93f3e9f6591162f8b1a9e96ed7e81ac385a6f4e1d0a3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b49a219665997a885ecdf79698144feb51c63bb716b2c7b344a04458c5ba669a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "出門逢惡，與福為患。反相擊刺，傷我手端。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b1455f448f3da250223f0bafff7d06eb9c31d447853c4b6e197638c6e9286fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ea56f1d8c9f96e360c840ebf0973320e39248b30a7bb2d0b17c63cea186d7167"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "獐鹿群走，自然燕喜。公子好遊，他人多有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89135668f0f2f6850b7ee256f2499fcd471ea7ffbe1dd6b00ab5127324eff192",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78bd57768077cd0d6d0c6aded9a962da03414ba0a47ce9d2c7cc1d0375cd53db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "恭寬信敏，履福不殆。從其邦域，與喜相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:acf622d65c12ed105305bdb3ddba68b39b83a082256518d06c21be96bc2bfb1a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:15a811e6277ff8f6fddfa34847cc9ee83ef5e204ff590f4675ca2a499259926f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "欲飛無翼，鼎重折足。失其福利，庖羞為賊。一下有上卿之家，富其蒙宰。喜除我憂，解吾思愁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aeca62eeeacaae364d245b60f593774979e3b0df2df4d829c4ab1b692c82ff15",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e33a3e423e40e6074e650f2df62cf1c0aa64ef4068b33945814246bbc5ebd42"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "府藏之富，王以賑貸。捕魚河海，布網多得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4757b05838539c07ed3c1daa5cd446947a31db7ae873b36c96b0daa7062ccd98",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:44a0864cdc6ff011e24d0207eb0c65e90c19a20cebb8d091d2ade2860a7c76f7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "陰生麓鹿，鼠舞鬼哭。靈龜陸處，釜甑塵生。仁智盤桓，國亂無歡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e89f05673f1374a8ff8a10bc138f8dad7e3d3afe16a032431cb93087a7fc859",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c56f627d87a1d025f55b7155151353af4fca04bb5f0204ce3d619486d2f96e28"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "風塵坎坷，不見南北。行迷失利，復反其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ed6dbdc67d07e112dd124caed7ec15e505ec0d4748938bca702c15bd5bd275da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:858c4188f0c0a5aa88d8b3cbd04a09d799db9fc7cd4edf7f052dd87f40f46266"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "金革白黃，宜利戎市。嫁娶有息，商人悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76084b70b499c626f06ca832cf6d7891b9199f79f8eb926c1121c0121a2050e5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab40f8d29877ef359db36f990c31c73bc6e7f5e8fd333f8b44f6d1c74d47f62b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "匏瓜之德，宜繫不食。君子失輿，官正懷憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:44bffd03490ff19c83a74675cf8b8caed609e39bb98331ebedb8e56f0dcb390f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c7205ca8654cfc68389b6f149025b8ef04db693c8e656107684bb76c04d9f81"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "乘船渡濟，載水逢火。賴得免患，我有所持。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:53b5b10468623ccbed1bae6a4ed2f3f4eadd942b07b337890e25c9292035ff71",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d007454d01bf78b496705648099189badeeb4b3e97e2976c91323e157902ef6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "道險多石，傷車折軸。與市為仇，不利客宿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d70640073b58f14c472c424b573baa65f82acaa074bf881cd314885079fe8887",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:85bb0c0f1511d9bdd5fa638be2021ddce2e73f70ea83b459b537680f153464ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "託寄之徒，不利請求。結衿無言，乃有悔患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00c532fbd5af42c59dda298df47a471dde438316158dc7e23a89fde93455fe86",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:40cf361261aba77980698a9c4c58b6f6faf28bab3bc3a0d8fb870da613e9c5a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "三年爭妻，相逐奔馳。終日不食，精氣竭罷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b3198f48f92eab9eebc5f0f14b1b3e142aa0dc2d0bb8b603a6da882b60e23f70",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1e9de06e41535fe2dca4fe62120bd3fdbf049e1f5fdce48c483218ec07070855"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "退惡防患，日之中息，解釋倒懸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:891b6a925825cc9eca5fb6039b58173e6fdc99a158457476c3ac673bf48bdf62",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b13fed0ad25dc134fd46b42f0af726f825d43f4c14724cb5d6e70c0f5e09be6e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "兩足四翼，飛入家國。寧我伯姊，與母相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e260e838321886ab279116111e71f5b6e628576fea673fc9e7e2dd08c18add1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ea67150e556d771e1b20b1d1a023b33f6bd627ac02f1337ded14e105afbe4d3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "寒露所凌，漸至堅冰。草木瘡瘍，花落葉亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dba90e0dae2cb70360490f0caa698534ac2f66981e12219a0d2e4b4568519909",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c347a1d2ce5e5de2c33494183d98085f06be7788078e7a7f32a3cf1d92da97b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "后稷農功，富利我國。南畝治理，一室百子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4c26091bcdc41ba8dcc5da8df7e7a8d9256e69add584ac0f8c83e296eb0f29e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:64bec87cf57a9fd4b99209ecaf8e2b73677b1dedb42265cdda8d065eb21a8df9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "設網張羅，捕魚園池。網罟自決，雖得復失。危許之患，受其忻懽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:681d3aa4f585707b7253e300d01f688779e7af3f2bd4774f3bcb2f37ec93e755",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b42a7d84c223f3669704cf6d870fa5d21a2d03737efba10c2a08a6afef47ff04"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "路與縣休，侯伯恣驕。上失其威，周室相微。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2d93ce1b959844d27416fb12d77688bf75aa999d943e0eea2f64daf07396ad0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce85724c6631ffe114870efeb22a637afa35bf557e1facd010e5697121ce7e92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "逐走追亡，相及扶桑。復見其鄉，使我悔喪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5de52979319afb98b6cfe63c161693a8d4e364f55bdf90f3f98eadcf24f2a1f9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a1b95d0e1ab8c3b25f2dcde3bf3e07636d115c27a5d8d0774f82914d6e5d2cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "履祿綏厚，載受福祉。衰微復起，繼世長久。疾病無危，晉人起告。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bca58ffa9248085cb11c6822ead2a5ae13986fcb7c07771e08f29805765e337d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d312d24bc5a938b066746ad542263a1418cca46c7b76639032a8007f6b65989"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "鰥寡孤獨，祿命苦薄。入宮無妻，武子哀悲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:86b59b6fd4b28287c3d5fd6ffbbf0096c288b31adfa7bc3a9dccb1c4cc6754db",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f187cc7a383816ef870093ff2271b3b6364de7a4436c634ef0302a19bc739156"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "山沒丘浮，陸為水魚。燕雀無巢，民無室廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1f8ac8293902846af022d0a12c5b1c079229d373de38f4a24211e4f92ad79e05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d824417fe8e5997eded01fd5446b4ba4a270f9b81cb09ea8b0529ef509aeb6e2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "冠帶南遊，與福喜期。遨遊嘉國，拜位逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:38e5078ac535aec59b7aa725d0f5dcb7c206cfff314447f0c8cbb80b301b2617",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32b024636f45924aefecb8963b7c0214059ce9e477f9ad5523eabc10cc13e746"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "東行亡羊，失其羝牂。少女無夫，獨坐空廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3376066995a36acb1d1065fc6a95400e6b57291899875ab13d62d9278255cc2f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:71021b32a6c9f7936543f59ca15462ad92d9d8c635a7206f6a8c6a1f316bcf9a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "探巢捕魚，耕田捕鰌。費日無功，右手虛空。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0697eff3da9bb777ca6ad5daab8054407becd27c4355ee482ebd14fd65b20af0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2d99da1c05e711bb1580e9bf88a0840a0b2ae6c97291ddc1d1d2341fc641622"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "東行飲酒，與喜相抱。福為我家，利來從母。水澤之徒，望邑而處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0c4d329224bf8bcc8cf392fad1cfeed6be98a34ced06ad4622cb6402c8cc5f19",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ca88d2ecfb1b54e872def5c5378caf35fe23ac29f724a7d431b2dc125ae9833d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "妄怒失精，自令畏悔。怡怡之懽，君子無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:08d39991b39e26bda07d8ca595b720f972fc40478e31f416a3922af90e9dd92b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dba2d4ecf39e39ee3e9baa6f3c7beb4d5814f5b6035d89447ebeafabfb6fa505"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "白雲如帶，往往來處。飛風送迎，大雹將下。擊我禾稼，僵死不起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4454c9500d343ac04852589e7b5114aca7752241ce46030ae9c7fa441e1dd66a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9ac0a34a86f631f15ea9fc922f5f23c9c0a2251435b8be8190fe59e4eda4508d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "南至之日，陽消不息。北風烈寒，萬物藏伏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42f0ff4715d663257c0b605973795c0450b510ed2e1bfc27be6e0be013874d19",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9974ef61b02d954b7850249b86be81c7180e1894a4e9b9b5efd0375d776096df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "火中仲夏，鴻雁解舍。體重難移，未能高舉。君子顯名，不失其譽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3f83012bb49977b976bc0db84f458be01a283b11322764244c935ef4adcb8773",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:37ee24330bf5e20a091317003fdbd42de22282819b45574857601a340944e2b1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "北行出門，履蹈躓顛。踒足據塗，污我襦褲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:362244f11227b6abab4ef32e518f7cb1b9ce8cde817e7f71575ae31b1dfba2e7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6797946ff953ead8f8728b01e4a383bd073b23c961e34a6fbd83cdaa10406d1a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "輕車醊祖，疾風暴起。促亂祭器，飛揚鼓舞。明神降佑，道無害寇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:022774ead6aecb7075d57b9e7683dec259a4b4ac286e3f277c3e3f5a090d58a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5c4b1d567b2e7d805746a88421c5d71ae85b0373fae6140a8d774a72832258f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "酒為歡伯，除憂來樂。福喜入門，與君相索。使我有得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9703da6290f491d19adc46c589372889e699cbba911cab49bd1004966200afa9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c5ac5bce688b6bbe0c779b009d5c1c19710a6d3ad5f62359098437df71404e4a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "三足孤烏，虛鳴督郵。司過罰惡，自賊其家。毀敗為憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3334ff1a31c3117d7cd971bcb960e00eba9490731a38bc581e4db108603b96c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a105cdbed630317cf8a5b3bd9937ad339c3973b159efc99a9b0f11117b46e98"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "三河俱合，水怒踴躍。壞我王屋，民飢於食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d43e9b179c75c9db292e0cfd0b5bd21ce1b012a15788ca3ffe9d17b0869db90b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fcad9733f6dcb00ea3dca44d9e5ac3190f36be5fc06a017fa9e2934b398e988"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "南行棗園，惡虎畏斑。執火銷鋒，使我無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9a5beaa12bbf0cd7a363d649a0aa939628648da6f2306729b86d48ac0128ffe3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7f07782eb7bc9b9f6aaa60ab55803e68ee45358b4b647fb10af086a75716cb7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "求鹿過山，與利為怨。闇襲不言，誰知其懽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:abe180cae413383d0a93cba9fc4379ec5053ef1a7bf32eb3249d9dcfe30e215c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50d31fa3050ee8b903d420c9b967710873336d5264081e1e67ae4eeb8eff74d2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "行旅困蹴，失明守宿。囹圄之憂，啟蟄出遊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11fe170ac910cb04cd25313f83f8d6bc70a0c0834fe9f3fffe56568362488344",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6d5b6d4c2f1408c38f8b4a662ebfd0f72244ce93d9c36d6872371a2b1e856f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 29,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "据棘履杞，跌刺為憂。夫婦不和，亂我良家。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:65af96a8a01bf82dab79903026abdfec60646c665994b8b63d071184d9c33b5d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:17e05738a7cf7542f1229988b13477e80b0a009e7a61159db9ba02fb92d31760"
    }
  ]
}
